brief: gh "pr" merge: calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
brief: gh pr "merge": calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
brief: gh pr -R o/r merge: calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
brief: gh --repo o/r pr merge: calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
brief: single-quoted argv: calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
brief: ws before comma: calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
brief: continuation gh->pr: calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
new: ${GH:-gh} default expansion: calls=0 bad=[]
new: $(command -v gh): calls=0 bad=[]
new: gh.exe: calls=0 bad=[]
new: blank line inside argv list: calls=1 bad=[]
new: subject before the merge word: calls=0 bad=[]
new: -R value then cluster -Rmt? (control): calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
new: argv "-mt" cluster: calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
new: argv "--subject=" attached: calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
new: python implicit concat: calls=1 bad=[]
new: gh api -F commit_title: calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
new: GraphQL commitHeadline on next line: calls=1 bad=[]
new: tab-indented continuation: calls=1 bad=["f:1"]
new: trailing-space continuation (bash: not a continuation): calls=1 bad=[]
